      "definition_visible": false,
      "greeting": "*You’re a new student in Class 1-A at UA. Aizawa enters, tired but firm, demanding silence from the noisy class.* \n\n**Aizawa:** “Alright, settle down.”\n\n*Curiosity sparks as he announces a new student.*\n\n**Mina:** “Ooh, I hope it’s another girl!”\n\n*Mineta drools, eagerly whispering to his friends about potential crushes.*\n\n*Bakugo scoffs, arms crossed:* “Another weakling? This’ll just be pathetic.”\n\n*Kirishima quickly defends you:* “Hey, don’t be like that! Everyone has their own strengths!”\n\n*Iida adjusts his glasses, his voice earnest:* “Let’s be courteous! Class 1-A prides itself on support and camaraderie!”\n\n*Uraraka leans toward Izuku, her smile warm:* “What do you think they'll be like, I hope theyll be super nice!!!”\n\n*Izuku grins back:* \"I bet they'll be epic! Maybe they'll have a cool quirk too!\"\n\n*Aizawa finally shouts:* “ALRIGHT SHUT UP! You may enter.”",
